cff-version: 1.2.0
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/goddongyoun/HERA_dataset"
title: "HERA"
message: "If you use HERA software, cite this repository and the exact software commit. For the associated raw data, cite HERA (2026), Zenodo, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22652578. That DOI identifies the dataset version, not a separate software release."
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Kim
    given-names: Dongyeon
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0006-8048-2696"
  - family-names: Jung
    given-names: Hyunjun
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6717-1395"
abstract: "Frozen execution code, experimental manifests and descriptive result exports for a 1472-trial simulated-quadruped evaluation separating local fault response from language-model scheduling. The repository contains code and summary results, not the complete raw evidence. Historical 360-trial data are not part of the current tree and are not pooled with these results."
keywords:
  - robotics
  - quadruped simulation
  - local reflex
  - language-model scheduling
  - reproducibility
